+
+**Confidence:** high (verified goals setup block has no player control and futsal sets no `maxPlayers`).
+
+---
+
+## Items explicitly verified as CORRECT (no action)
+
+- **Engine routing:** `engine: 'goals'` → in-component goals scorer for quick, `MonoGoalsLiveScore.jsx` for tournament. Correct for futsal.
