+- **Save → history:** futsal quick match draws produce a "Draw" winner (`MonoQuickMatch.jsx:1154–1172`), persist to `se_quickmatches`, and surface in `MonoHistory` as sport "Futsal" with working draw filter (`MonoHistory.jsx:258–276, 123`).
