+**What's wrong:** Tennis and squash are visually indistinguishable in any list/picker that keys on the emoji; same for pickleball vs table tennis. In the racquet-sports category these four sit together (`getSportsByCategory`, `sportRegistry.js:463-469`), so the duplication is visible side by side.
